oggle to not show up in the first half of the first inning in singleplayer", "created_date": 1786139218, "id": "27843584191927212", "version": "2.5886", "version_code": 5886, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27843579005261064"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3256881337690839", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27843584191927212"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3208127792574896"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes (Beta v2.5885):\nBug Fixes:\nFixed an issue in free roam causing the ball to appear in different spots on different clients if some of the clients had significantly worse ping than the others\nImprovements:\nAdded a bat type toggle to batting practice\nAdded a strike zone size toggle to all singleplayer modes\nNew Features:\nAdded a strike zone size toggle in singleplayer and practice modes", "created_date": 1786052826, "id": "27830712466547718", "version": "2.5885", "version_code": 5885, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27830707616548203"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3256881337690839", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27843584191927212"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3208127792574896"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes (Live v2.5884):\nBug Fixes:\nFixed booth ads not working in multiplayer 1v1 between innings\nFixed announcer audio not playing between innings in multiplayer 1v1\nFixed megaphone speakers in the announcer booth not animating in multiplayer 1v1 when the announcer says something\nFixed megaphone speakers in the announcer booth not animating in multiplayer 1v1 or singleplayer during the opening sequence of the game\nFixed the crowd being invisible when looking at their backs while in the booth in multiplayer\nFixed pulling the booth controls lever in announcer mode disabling the announcer controls instead of retracting them back into the announcer table, rendering the controls unusable\nFixed an issue causing AI batters to not take their base on a walk triggered by 4 balls in solo 1v1\nFixed homerun fireworks not showing up on homeruns batted by AI batters in solo 1v1\nFixed homerun fireworks not showing up on homeruns in announcer mode\nFixed an issue causing the player to sometimes become extra tall when having picked the sitting option for their sit/stand playing position\nFixed an issue in solo 1v1 causing 2 AI players to stand on home plate, one with a bat and one without\nFixed an issue causing AI players to return to the center of home plate in solo 1v1 instead of their batting position after batting a foul\nFixed AI players sometimes ignoring the ball if the defense player shoots it to them in 1v1 (solo and multiplayer) from a distance (note they will still ignore the ball if a human player is close to the AI player, this is intended)\nFixed the game getting stuck on homeruns in multiplayer 1v1 (again, ugh)\nFixed the catcher sometimes getting stuck after triggering a walk from 4 balls\nFixed an issue causing the game to get stuck in multiplayer 1v1 if the defense player throws the ball outside the field after the offense player scores\nFixed an issue causing human catchers to sometimes be unable to catch the ball in multiplayer 1v1 and free roam\nFixed an issue causing catchers to be able to yank batted balls away from the batter in free roam\nFixed an issue causing players to see a batted ball in different positions in free roam\nFixed an issue sometimes causing the ball to launch out of a player\u2019s hand at ridiculous speeds in free roam\nImprovements:\nMade enhancements to catching so it\u2019s reactive even on bad (high ping) networks, both in multiplayer 1v1 and free roam\nMade the ball only return to the pitcher in multiplayer 1v1 after a batted homerun only after the offense player has scored\nAdded a volume bounds to prevent the announcer mode custom camera from clipping outside fields\nNew Features:\nAdded Announcer mode to the Quest and Pico versions of the game!", "created_date": 1785474702, "id": "27750606724558293", "version": "2.5884", "version_code": 5884, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27750602911225341"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3256881337690839", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27843584191927212"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1784932823, "id": "27680177398267893", "version": "2.5883", "version_code": 5883, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27680174598268173"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}